(7492607, 1192645, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''ve been going back and forth -- I probably agree that the chain distracts, but it still is an interesting addition... I''m wondering if you had shot down a bit on it, so that it wasn''t so up front and taking the eye? Or even arranging it so that it trailed off back behind into the shadows? Just curious... :)<br/> <br/>Nicely done!</td>', 'I''ve been going back and forth -- I probably agree that the chain distracts, but it still is an interesting addition... I''m wondering if you had shot down a bit on it, so that it wasn''t so up front and taking the eye? Or even arranging it so that it trailed off back behind into the shadows? Just curious... :) Nicely done!', '2017-01-17 09:37:49.000000', NULL, 0),
