(7492609, 1193206, 103142, '<td valign="top">Yup -- definitely the cropped version! And you cropped it exactly perfect in that one. Just above the trailer hitch was great! You would have beaten my by a mile with that. :)<br/> <br/>Nicely seen!<br/> <br/>(Did you try any shots from a lower vantage point? I''m trying to see things from different points of view, and I''m curious if you shot up at all in any of the outtakes?)<br/> <br/>Congrats on the HM!</td>', 'Yup -- definitely the cropped version! And you cropped it exactly perfect in that one. Just above the trailer hitch was great! You would have beaten my by a mile with that. :) Nicely seen! (Did you try any shots from a lower vantage point? I''m trying to see things from different points of view, and I''m curious if you shot up at all in any of the outtakes?) Congrats on the HM!', '2017-01-17 09:41:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7492610, 1193217, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ummm... how does a 3rd grader know about wenches?!?!?<br/> <br/>I love the rope in this one. Great tones and fun find. I wonder about cropping it down quite a bit -- just above the ball handle?<br/> <br/>Congrats on the HM!</td>', 'Ummm... how does a 3rd grader know about wenches?!?!? I love the rope in this one. Great tones and fun find. I wonder about cropping it down quite a bit -- just above the ball handle? Congrats on the HM!', '2017-01-17 09:43:03.000000', NULL, 0),
