(7492897, 1193191, 19825, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mitalapo:</b></div><hr/><i> this is different than <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1192947" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2404/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1192947.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2404/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1192947.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2404/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1192947.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I found this comment helpful. I don''t know about you. Nicely done, Niall.</td>', 'Originally posted by mitalapo: this is different than   I found this comment helpful. I don''t know about you. Nicely done, Niall.', '2017-01-18 12:13:33.000000', NULL, 0),
